abstract: >
  A harmonized geospatial database of historical earthquakes affecting
  the Dead Sea Transform and adjacent regions. The database integrates
  historical documentary evidence, archaeological observations,
  environmental earthquake effects, and geographic information into a
  standardized relational structure suitable for historical seismology,
  archaeoseismology, Historical GIS, and interdisciplinary geoscientific research.
